sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over Product, CN: Precondition: connected, IoCapabilities set to displayYesNo or keyboardDisplay

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)

    Note over Product: Display passkey, user confirms match

    alt User confirms
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    else User rejects
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(false)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false, reason=numericComparisonFailed)
    else Timeout (30s SMP timeout)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false, reason=timeout)
    end
